Z||000014||theogre||05-06-99||08:20 PM||||I've seen them at Pep-Boys, Strauss, and others. There are 2 types from the same maker, I forget just who that is.<p>one fits every thing. you buy it for around 250$us, and then add what ever additional cables at around 30$ each.<p>The others are brand specific and come with the cable, for about 150$us. there's 3 diferant ones of these. Ford, GM, Chrysler. Each one covers all divisions of the company. Check what years are covered as well... I don't think these cover some of the really new stuff.
